    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source b455 SNOMED CT 248243004 = ICF b455: the body functions of EXERCISE TOLERANCE —
        cardiovascular and respiratory capacity as required for enduring physical exertion (per WHO
