        """
}
mapping "b4550.1" source="b4550" target="SNOMED_CT:248243004" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source b4550 SNOMED CT 248243004 = ICF b4550: the specific body function of GENERAL physical
        endurance (overall stamina for sustained physical exertion). Target =, active RF2 production,
        the SNOMED CT observable that names exercise tolerance. This is the closest standard equivalent;
        the SNOMED CT 248243004 359755007 was also considered (stamina = endurance) but 248243004 is the
        more specific exercise-tolerance framing and matches the b455 parent hierarchy. Broader rather
        than narrower/exact: ICF b4550 is slightly broader than SNOMED CT (endurance includes everyday
        sustained activity, exercise tolerance is the exertion-tolerance assessment), but as the single
        best target it stands broader for the endurance domain. Moderate tier : direct term-and-scope
        match, term-verified active, but the source vs target framing has a real breadth mismatch
        (one-level), and no independent Athena crosswalk re-verified.
        """
}
